<view class="container">
  <block wx:if="{{uiState === 'loading'}}">
    <view class="tw-state">加载中…</view>
  </block>
  <block wx:elif="{{uiState === 'error'}}">
    <view class="tw-state">
      <view>事件加载失败</view>
      <view class="tw-muted err-msg">{{errorMsg}}</view>
      <button class="tw-btn-primary retry-btn" bindtap="load">重试</button>
    </view>
  </block>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="tw-card">
      <view class="ev-id">{{eventId}}</view>
      <view class="tw-page-title">{{detail.title || '—'}}</view>
      <view class="tw-muted">
        事件完整时间线、证据与假设请在 PC 端「演化研判工作台」查看；
        小程序提供现场巡检所需的关键信息。
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="tw-card">
      <view class="tw-card-title">基本信息（M3 接口对接后展示）</view>
      <view class="tw-state placeholder">等待后端事件接口就绪</view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
